					<description><![CDATA[In reply to &lt;a href=&quot;https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/malaria/#comment-6283&quot;&gt;Basemera&lt;/a&gt;.

many liquids such as suspensions can separate into different layers, so the active ingredients which may be in a solid form may settle at the bottom of the container leaving the liquid part to settle at the top]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>In reply to <a href="https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/malaria/#comment-6283">Basemera</a>.</p>
<p>many liquids such as suspensions can separate into different layers, so the active ingredients which may be in a solid form may settle at the bottom of the container leaving the liquid part to settle at the top</p>
]]></content:encoded>
		
